# FMEA / FMECA

Follow IEC 60812 principles.

For every hardware item provide:

- Function
- Failure Mode
- Failure Cause
- Local Effect
- Higher-Level Effect
- End Effect
- Detection Method
- Mitigation
- Recommended Action

Do not combine failure modes within one row.

Use standardized engineering terminology.

